id=alioth_loud
name=Alioth Loud
version=v0.3.1
versionCode=4
author=f3
description=[probe-verified for aliothin / HyperOS 1.0.10 CN] Volume ceiling removal for POCO F3. Layer 3 flattens the volume curve at boot (+12.7 dB at half volume, measured); layers 4a/4b add WCD headset gain and Cirrus CS35L41 amp gain, both off until you opt in. Patches live vendor configs at boot instead of shipping static files, so it survives HyperOS updates. NOTE: max volume is unchanged by design - see config.sh.
